WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.230
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.500 --> 01:38.970
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.509 --> 01:41.750
[Episode 20]

4
01:41.970 --> 01:42.570
[Yu Changxuan, the New Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Yu Army,]

5
01:42.600 --> 01:43.470
[Had a Secret Talk with Kurata Ichiro the Colonel General of the Japanese Army]

6
01:44.650 --> 01:46.640
Why is Fifth Young Master Yu getting so close

7
01:46.640 --> 01:48.370
to the Japanese all of a sudden?

8
01:49.979 --> 01:52.360
Nowadays, almost all warlords are

9
01:52.539 --> 01:54.390
colluding with foreign powers.

10
01:54.840 --> 01:56.840
Raising an army needs money, right?

11
01:56.920 --> 01:59.240
Going to battle requires firearms and ammunition, right?

12
01:59.240 --> 02:00.560
Everything in this world

13
02:00.560 --> 02:01.980
can be concluded as a big business.

14
02:01.980 --> 02:03.260
Doesn't that make him

15
02:03.310 --> 02:04.610
like the President,

16
02:04.760 --> 02:05.890
despised and cursed

17
02:05.950 --> 02:07.950
by everyone for the rest of his life?

18
02:07.950 --> 02:08.860
Shut up.

19
02:12.250 --> 02:13.500
You've got no proof,

20
02:13.800 --> 02:15.170
yet you're talking nonsense

21
02:15.170 --> 02:16.300
and gossiping here?

22
02:16.810 --> 02:18.720
It's already in the newspapers.

23
02:18.750 --> 02:20.290
The whole city is talking about it.

24
02:20.290 --> 02:21.430
Why can't we?

25
02:23.020 --> 02:24.210
Did you see it with your own eyes

26
02:24.210 --> 02:25.810
or hear it with your own ears?

27
02:26.100 --> 02:28.470
This is Fifth Young Master Yu's Xiangxi Hotel.

28
02:28.470 --> 02:29.400
Every one of us

29
02:29.400 --> 02:30.730
is making a living here.

30
02:31.780 --> 02:33.800
If anyone dares to slander Fifth Young Master Yu again,

31
02:33.800 --> 02:35.130
I'll request Master Jin

32
02:35.240 --> 02:36.530
to kick them out

33
02:36.870 --> 02:38.000
without exception.

34
02:41.760 --> 02:46.720
[Xing Newspaper]

35
02:52.829 --> 02:58.860
[Nanhuai]

36
03:07.850 --> 03:09.040
Who is this big shot?

37
03:09.060 --> 03:12.020
It's said to be Military Governor Chu, a higher-up.

38
03:13.220 --> 03:14.560
-Step back! -Back! Back!

39
03:14.560 --> 03:16.900
[Nanhai Military General Staff Department]

40
03:22.579 --> 03:24.630
Down with imperialism!

41
03:26.680 --> 03:28.530
Down with imperialism!

42
03:29.590 --> 03:30.960
Down with the traitor!

43
03:33.470 --> 03:35.340
Down with imperialism!

44
03:35.860 --> 03:40.070
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

45
03:44.610 --> 03:45.750
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

46
03:45.750 --> 03:46.530
It's been years,

47
03:46.530 --> 03:47.870
yet the layout of your office

48
03:47.870 --> 03:49.620
hasn't changed a bit.

49
03:50.060 --> 03:51.340
Seeing these things

50
03:51.800 --> 03:53.460
brings back so many memories.

51
03:54.870 --> 03:56.400
You wrote these words—loyalty,

52
03:56.400 --> 03:58.190
filial piety, and integrity for me.

53
03:58.190 --> 03:58.410
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

54
03:58.410 --> 04:00.080
I've engraved them in my mind

55
04:00.520 --> 04:01.920
and dare not forget them.

56
04:02.180 --> 04:03.870
We of the older generation

57
04:04.410 --> 04:06.680
know honor and integrity.

58
04:10.130 --> 04:11.460
We won't collude

59
04:11.460 --> 04:12.400
with dangerous enemies

60
04:12.400 --> 04:13.780
just for some personal interests,

61
04:13.780 --> 04:16.500
let alone be disloyal and unrighteous.

62
04:19.800 --> 04:21.519
Today's youngsters

63
04:21.519 --> 04:22.180
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

64
04:22.180 --> 04:23.750
are really unruly.

65
04:30.690 --> 04:32.020
Military Governor Chu.

66
04:32.890 --> 04:34.450
If you trust me,

67
04:36.120 --> 04:38.300
I hope you'll trust Changxuan, too.

68
04:41.100 --> 04:42.630
A father knows his son best.

69
04:44.560 --> 04:46.950
This boy will never do anything to harm

70
04:47.750 --> 04:49.510
the great cause of the country.

71
04:50.690 --> 04:53.070
It's not about whether I believe it or not.

72
04:54.810 --> 04:56.159
But I must give the authority

73
04:56.159 --> 04:57.490
an explanation.

74
04:58.130 --> 05:00.190
[Loyalty, Filial Piety, Integrity]

75
05:00.190 --> 05:02.040
So today, I must

76
05:02.040 --> 05:03.860
take Changxuan away

77
05:04.190 --> 05:06.100
to the Sujing Military Court

78
05:06.100 --> 05:08.000
for a public trial.

79
05:09.240 --> 05:10.190
We'll see if he

80
05:10.190 --> 05:11.540
really has

81
05:11.540 --> 05:13.930
any intention of treason.

82
05:36.060 --> 05:37.450
Changxuan. Changxuan!

83
05:38.130 --> 05:39.590
You absolutely cannot go.

84
05:40.270 --> 05:41.300
On your way there,

85
05:41.920 --> 05:44.380
if Chu Wenfu has already decided to kill you,

86
05:44.690 --> 05:46.300
who could possibly stop him?

87
05:52.830 --> 05:53.510
Changxuan!

88
05:57.630 --> 05:58.680
Down with the traitor!

89
05:58.680 --> 05:59.890
Down with imperialism!

90
05:59.890 --> 06:01.240
Down with the traitor!

91
06:01.450 --> 06:03.370
Down with imperialism!

92
06:03.500 --> 06:04.660
Down with the traitor!

93
06:04.660 --> 06:07.320
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

94
06:08.270 --> 06:09.130
How rude of you.

95
06:10.250 --> 06:11.770
How can you handcuff

96
06:12.060 --> 06:13.620
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu?

97
06:13.620 --> 06:16.550
Military Governor, we are just following the rules.

98
06:19.480 --> 06:22.340
Deputy Commander Yu, my apologies for any offense.

99
06:23.510 --> 06:25.480
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

100
06:25.480 --> 06:27.540
-Down with imperialism! -Down with imperialism!

101
06:27.540 --> 06:29.620
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

102
06:29.620 --> 06:31.690
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

103
06:31.690 --> 06:33.620
-Please. -Down with imperialism!

104
06:33.720 --> 06:35.800
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

105
06:35.800 --> 06:37.600
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

106
06:37.600 --> 06:39.920
-Down with imperialism! -Down with imperialism!

107
06:39.920 --> 06:42.290
-Down with the traitor! -Down with the traitor!

108
06:42.290 --> 06:43.920
Down with the traitor!

109
06:43.980 --> 06:45.930
-Down with imperialism! -Down with imperialism!

110
06:45.930 --> 06:47.780
Down with the traitor!

111
06:48.520 --> 06:50.020
Down with the traitor!

112
06:51.060 --> 06:52.190
Down with the traitor!

113
06:52.190 --> 06:53.070
Yu Changxuan.

114
07:00.070 --> 07:00.870
Yu Changxuan!

115
07:03.420 --> 07:05.010
Down with the traitor!

116
07:10.740 --> 07:11.540
Yu Changxuan!

117
07:15.980 --> 07:17.100
Yu Changxuan!

118
07:19.120 --> 07:20.250
Yu Changxuan!

119
07:24.870 --> 07:26.180
Stay back! Get out!

120
07:26.180 --> 07:27.060
No entry!

121
07:27.720 --> 07:29.010
No entry! Stay back!

122
07:29.920 --> 07:31.420
Down with the traitor!

123
07:31.560 --> 07:33.010
Down with the traitor!

124
07:33.159 --> 07:34.070
Yu Changxuan!

125
07:36.350 --> 07:37.550
Yu Changxuan.

126
07:38.450 --> 07:39.250
Yu Changxuan!

127
07:41.510 --> 07:42.170
Stop there!

128
07:42.690 --> 07:43.630
Don't touch her!

129
07:53.810 --> 07:54.800
Yu Changxuan.

130
07:57.000 --> 07:58.330
What are you doing here?

131
07:58.810 --> 08:00.010
I don't believe

132
08:00.030 --> 08:02.090
you would collude with the Japanese.

133
08:02.610 --> 08:03.950
Who are you?

134
08:04.310 --> 08:05.660
How dare you hinder

135
08:05.890 --> 08:07.480
the execution of official duties

136
08:07.480 --> 08:09.280
outside the army headquarters?

137
08:13.010 --> 08:14.620
You shouldn't be here.

138
08:15.950 --> 08:17.070
I know you had dinner

139
08:17.070 --> 08:18.690
with the Japanese because of me.

140
08:18.690 --> 08:19.450
I don't believe

141
08:19.450 --> 08:20.270
you would compromise

142
08:20.270 --> 08:21.220
your principles for this.

143
08:21.220 --> 08:22.480
Don't be so confident.

144
08:23.240 --> 08:24.700
You think you know me well?

145
08:27.070 --> 08:27.560
Boren!

146
08:27.740 --> 08:28.270
Yes, sir!

147
08:28.450 --> 08:29.250
Take her away.

148
08:32.030 --> 08:32.830
Yu Changxuan.

149
08:32.860 --> 08:33.860
Come on, let's go.

150
08:35.250 --> 08:35.909
Let go of me!

151
08:37.150 --> 08:37.750
Everyone,

152
08:38.600 --> 08:40.330
after the battle in Luanjiang,

153
08:40.480 --> 08:41.549
quite a lot of local armies

154
08:41.549 --> 08:43.010
wanted to join the Yu Army.

155
08:43.390 --> 08:44.120
But Fifth Young Master Yu

156
08:44.120 --> 08:45.580
has laid down clear rules—

157
08:45.580 --> 08:46.720
no opening railways

158
08:46.790 --> 08:48.410
and ports to the Japanese,

159
08:48.630 --> 08:49.840
no selling weapons

160
08:50.120 --> 08:51.720
or minerals to the Japanese,

161
08:51.740 --> 08:52.220
no leasing

162
08:52.220 --> 08:53.820
land to the Japanese.

163
08:54.250 --> 08:55.410
These 3 rules were

164
08:55.780 --> 08:57.460
all published in the newspapers.

165
08:57.460 --> 08:57.830
[Down with Japanese Imperialism!]

166
08:57.830 --> 08:59.500
I work at the Xiangxi Hotel.

167
08:59.760 --> 09:01.470
I've seen the Japanese approach

168
09:01.470 --> 09:03.760
Fifth Young Master Yu for cooperation several times,

169
09:03.760 --> 09:05.450
but he rejected them all.

170
09:06.270 --> 09:07.200
If he really wanted

171
09:07.200 --> 09:08.240
to collude with the Japanese,

172
09:08.240 --> 09:09.900
why would he wait until today?

173
09:32.770 --> 09:33.630
Ye Pingjun,

174
09:35.290 --> 09:36.480
you're an outsider.

175
09:36.650 --> 09:39.380
What right do you have to interfere in my affairs?

176
09:43.910 --> 09:44.370
Yes,

177
09:45.700 --> 09:46.820
I am an outsider.

178
09:50.100 --> 09:50.940
Commander Yu,

179
09:52.000 --> 09:53.420
even I, an outsider,

180
09:53.920 --> 09:54.390
know that

181
09:54.390 --> 09:55.290
Fifth Young Master Yu

182
09:55.290 --> 09:56.460
would never do this.

183
09:57.910 --> 09:59.550
As his father,

184
09:59.860 --> 10:01.860
don't you know him better than I do?

185
10:02.250 --> 10:04.710
Don't you know his character and ambitions?

186
10:15.240 --> 10:16.030
Zhongquan,

187
10:17.580 --> 10:19.630
are you just going to let a little girl

188
10:19.630 --> 10:20.790
mess around here?

189
10:28.220 --> 10:28.980
Boren!

190
10:30.130 --> 10:30.940
Take her away.

191
10:31.980 --> 10:33.000
Hurry...

192
10:33.220 --> 10:33.940
What are you doing?

193
10:33.940 --> 10:35.000
Let's go, let's go.

194
10:36.690 --> 10:38.150
Hear me out first.

195
10:38.150 --> 10:38.910
What's the rush? Come on.

196
10:38.910 --> 10:40.080
Deputy Commander Yu,

197
10:40.080 --> 10:41.470
we can't delay any longer.

198
10:41.470 --> 10:42.270
Get in the car.

199
10:43.550 --> 10:44.280
No, don't go!

200
10:44.580 --> 10:46.000
Don't go! Just look!

201
10:59.530 --> 11:00.030
Wait.

202
11:08.320 --> 11:09.650
Military Governor Chu.

203
11:11.500 --> 11:13.360
Changxuan can't go with you.

204
11:14.920 --> 11:16.550
What do you mean?

205
11:19.770 --> 11:20.770
Since this matter

206
11:20.770 --> 11:22.630
happened in Nanhuai,

207
11:23.790 --> 11:25.650
It's only right

208
11:25.650 --> 11:26.600
to get to the bottom

209
11:26.600 --> 11:27.790
of it in Nanhuai.

210
11:29.670 --> 11:30.630
Do you agree?

211
11:40.010 --> 11:40.820
Zhongquan,

212
11:42.320 --> 11:43.050
you'd better

213
11:43.320 --> 11:45.000
think this through.

214
11:46.740 --> 11:47.870
Military Governor,

215
11:49.320 --> 11:50.940
Changxuan is my only son

216
11:52.700 --> 11:54.220
and the future commander-in-chief

217
11:54.220 --> 11:55.340
of the Yu Army.

218
11:57.110 --> 11:58.150
As his father,

219
11:58.790 --> 11:59.960
I cannot

220
11:59.960 --> 12:02.200
risk anything happening to him.

221
12:04.100 --> 12:05.900
If he is to face a court-martial,

222
12:06.100 --> 12:08.890
I should be the one to escort him there.

223
12:10.010 --> 12:11.120
If he is guilty,

224
12:12.290 --> 12:13.410
I should also

225
12:13.410 --> 12:16.050
stand in the dock beside him.

226
12:27.520 --> 12:29.500
Yu Zhongquan,

227
12:31.050 --> 12:33.650
you are openly disobeying orders!

228
12:37.750 --> 12:38.810
What are you doing?

229
13:05.910 --> 13:07.170
Commander-in-Chief!

230
13:16.360 --> 13:17.020
Commander,

231
13:17.960 --> 13:19.620
please review the documents.

232
13:20.870 --> 13:21.100
[Archive]

233
13:21.100 --> 13:22.240
Actually, Fifth Young Master Yu

234
13:22.240 --> 13:22.770
knew Takahashi

235
13:22.770 --> 13:23.870
and Kurata Ichiro's true purpose

236
13:23.870 --> 13:25.270
from the very beginning.

237
13:28.930 --> 13:29.710
Takahashi

238
13:29.740 --> 13:31.510
claims to transport cotton for spinning,

239
13:31.510 --> 13:32.050
but in reality,

240
13:32.050 --> 13:33.840
he's trying to smuggle tungsten back to Japan.

241
13:33.840 --> 13:34.550
How dare

242
13:34.550 --> 13:35.410
they smuggle

243
13:35.410 --> 13:36.670
right under our noses?

244
13:37.390 --> 13:39.650
That's all the more reason for me to cooperate with them.

245
13:39.650 --> 13:40.500
For what?

246
13:42.020 --> 13:44.120
Only by pretending to cooperate with them

247
13:44.120 --> 13:44.840
can we swap

248
13:44.840 --> 13:46.190
this batch of tungsten

249
13:46.390 --> 13:48.360
before their freighter leaves the port

250
13:48.360 --> 13:49.290
and stop them

251
13:49.750 --> 13:51.360
from delivering the raw materials for guns

252
13:51.360 --> 13:52.290
back to Japan.

253
13:53.290 --> 13:53.950
Changxuan,

254
13:54.960 --> 13:56.360
this is extremely risky.

255
13:56.510 --> 13:57.790
What if word gets out that we are

256
13:57.790 --> 13:59.590
trading with the Japanese army?

257
14:00.890 --> 14:02.040
Despite its risk,

258
14:02.700 --> 14:03.790
we must do it.

259
14:04.080 --> 14:05.550
We absolutely can't let the Japanese

260
14:05.550 --> 14:07.010
smuggle our raw materials

261
14:07.290 --> 14:08.500
to make guns.

262
14:09.250 --> 14:09.910
Commander,

263
14:10.030 --> 14:10.630
Governor,

264
14:10.910 --> 14:12.460
we have seized the tungsten.

265
14:12.460 --> 14:14.700
It is stored in the Nanhuai Port's warehouse,

266
14:14.700 --> 14:16.560
ready for inspection at any time.

267
14:21.750 --> 14:23.170
He really is innocent.

268
14:44.030 --> 14:45.000
Changxuan,

269
14:45.720 --> 14:46.950
if that's the case,

270
14:47.290 --> 14:49.150
why didn't you tell us so earlier?

271
14:50.530 --> 14:52.330
I didn't want to alert the enemy.

272
14:52.740 --> 14:54.540
Before the seizure of tungsten,

273
14:54.700 --> 14:57.030
there couldn't be the slightest slip-up.

274
15:01.070 --> 15:02.140
Mr. Chu,

275
15:02.230 --> 15:04.500
you specifically made a trip here for nothing.

276
15:04.500 --> 15:05.760
Please don't blame me.

277
15:11.390 --> 15:13.820
You did this for the greater good of the nation.

278
15:13.820 --> 15:16.150
How could I possibly blame you?

279
15:19.610 --> 15:21.410
Come on, say thank you to Mr. Chu.

280
15:23.170 --> 15:24.230
Thank you, Mr. Chu!

281
15:26.710 --> 15:28.510
Military Governor, you've gone

282
15:28.820 --> 15:29.910
to so much trouble

283
15:30.770 --> 15:32.410
coming all the way here for this matter.

284
15:32.410 --> 15:33.870
Thank you for your effort.

285
15:34.390 --> 15:36.460
Would you like to stay a few more days

286
15:36.860 --> 15:38.390
and join me for a few drinks?

287
15:38.650 --> 15:39.340
No, thanks.

288
15:40.620 --> 15:42.410
I still need to go to Sujing

289
15:42.750 --> 15:45.010
to report this matter to the higher-ups.

290
15:45.510 --> 15:46.240
Understood.

291
15:46.460 --> 15:47.340
Let's take a rain check?

292
15:47.340 --> 15:47.840
Sure.

293
15:47.910 --> 15:48.390
Deal?

294
15:48.600 --> 15:48.960
Deal.

295
15:49.050 --> 15:49.440
Nice.

296
16:12.750 --> 16:13.440
Alright,

297
16:15.250 --> 16:16.110
go do your work.

298
17:05.050 --> 17:06.430
I'm Zhou Tai from Yu's Residence.

299
17:06.430 --> 17:08.960
Is there any news about Fifth Young Master Yu?

300
17:09.420 --> 17:11.220
Please continue to look for him.

301
17:14.640 --> 17:15.089
Madam,

302
17:16.329 --> 17:17.859
there are still no updates.

303
17:20.849 --> 17:21.530
Seems like

304
17:22.740 --> 17:24.640
I have to go to the army myself.

305
17:25.240 --> 17:26.460
-Mom. -Mom, calm down.

306
17:26.460 --> 17:27.270
The situation

307
17:27.270 --> 17:28.510
still remains unclear now.

308
17:28.510 --> 17:30.960
What else do you need to know about the situation?

309
17:30.960 --> 17:31.940
Chu Wenfu has already

310
17:31.940 --> 17:33.380
gone to the army to demand they hand him over.

311
17:33.380 --> 17:34.400
He came prepared,

312
17:34.400 --> 17:35.920
with an aggressive approach.

313
17:35.920 --> 17:37.110
I can't just sit back

314
17:37.110 --> 17:39.240
and watch him take my son away

315
17:39.810 --> 17:42.290
without doing anything!

316
17:42.590 --> 17:43.720
-Mom, Mom. -Mom.

317
17:43.720 --> 17:44.610
You can't go, Mom.

318
17:44.610 --> 17:45.700
Say no more!

319
17:46.000 --> 17:46.850
Get the car ready.

320
17:46.850 --> 17:47.690
Yes, Madam.

321
17:50.420 --> 17:50.880
Mom.

322
17:53.530 --> 17:55.060
You're back, Young Master.

323
17:57.550 --> 17:58.570
The Young Master is back!

324
17:58.570 --> 17:59.450
Changxuan?

325
17:59.550 --> 18:00.140
Mom.

326
18:00.960 --> 18:02.310
You're finally back.

327
18:02.500 --> 18:04.290
Did you get hurt?

328
18:05.570 --> 18:06.260
Mom,

329
18:06.720 --> 18:07.310
I'm fine.

330
18:07.920 --> 18:09.200
Changxuan, you have no idea.

331
18:09.200 --> 18:10.350
Mom's been worrying about you

332
18:10.350 --> 18:12.350
and hasn't slept properly for days.

333
18:13.500 --> 18:15.720
I had the kitchen stew some tonic soup for you.

334
18:15.720 --> 18:16.510
Go take a bath,

335
18:16.510 --> 18:18.640
get changed, and then come to drink it.

336
18:19.900 --> 18:21.700
Sorry for making you worry, Mom.

337
18:21.920 --> 18:22.720
I'll go, then.

338
18:24.770 --> 18:25.680
Go ahead.

339
18:27.110 --> 18:28.440
Young Master, this way.

340
18:30.220 --> 18:31.110
Feel easy now?

341
18:33.550 --> 18:35.310
He's finally back.

342
19:00.440 --> 19:01.500
Don't touch her!

343
19:18.220 --> 19:19.920
You shouldn't be here.

344
19:21.590 --> 19:22.290
Boren!

345
19:22.290 --> 19:22.850
Yes, sir!

346
19:23.000 --> 19:23.800
Take her away.

347
19:25.580 --> 19:26.580
Come on, let's go.

348
19:54.810 --> 19:57.140
Mom, I'm heading out to get your medicine.

349
19:57.400 --> 19:58.600
Don't be out too late.

350
20:27.140 --> 20:28.540
Why did you help me today?

351
20:32.850 --> 20:33.750
You risked your life

352
20:33.750 --> 20:35.280
to save me and my mom before.

353
20:35.610 --> 20:36.660
No matter what,

354
20:36.660 --> 20:37.920
I couldn't just stand by and watch.

355
20:37.920 --> 20:39.580
That's not what I want to hear.

356
20:44.750 --> 20:46.420
But that's all I have to say.

357
20:53.660 --> 20:54.460
Yu Changxuan,

358
20:54.770 --> 20:56.500
what are you doing? Let me go.

359
21:02.050 --> 21:03.180
I want to hear you say

360
21:05.110 --> 21:06.770
that you have feelings for me.

361
21:11.050 --> 21:11.740
Just say it.

362
21:15.590 --> 21:17.450
Say that you have feelings for me.

363
21:25.360 --> 21:26.210
Mr. Yu,

364
21:27.210 --> 21:29.670
I just wanted to express my gratitude to you.

365
21:30.000 --> 21:31.770
There was nothing more to it.

366
21:46.400 --> 21:48.060
Is it fun fooling me like this?

367
21:52.000 --> 21:53.420
Seeing me swallow my pride and beg you,

368
21:53.420 --> 21:54.750
do you feel pretty smug?

369
21:59.000 --> 22:00.270
I told you ages ago—

370
22:00.660 --> 22:01.720
if you have no feelings for me,

371
22:01.720 --> 22:04.050
then disappear from my world completely.

372
22:04.510 --> 22:05.330
How could you come

373
22:05.330 --> 22:06.330
and help me today?

374
22:11.310 --> 22:12.050
Ye Pingjun.

375
22:16.500 --> 22:18.300
How can you torture me like this?

376
23:19.160 --> 23:19.960
I don't get it.

377
23:28.260 --> 23:29.460
I really don't get it.

378
24:20.400 --> 24:26.140
[Fuxingde Famous Tea]

379
24:35.500 --> 24:37.100
I just want to hear you say it.

380
24:39.220 --> 24:40.060
Just say it.

381
24:43.880 --> 24:45.740
Say that you have feelings for me.

382
25:06.720 --> 25:07.750
You've obviously taken things

383
25:07.750 --> 25:09.030
out of context in this article.

384
25:09.030 --> 25:10.070
I gave you the photo

385
25:10.070 --> 25:11.730
not for you to twist the facts!

386
25:12.460 --> 25:13.920
Yu Changxuan is a warlord.

387
25:15.530 --> 25:17.130
Warlords like him always use

388
25:17.330 --> 25:19.420
their armies to consolidate their power.

389
25:19.420 --> 25:20.880
They're greedy and cruel.

390
25:21.270 --> 25:22.000
He is the first target

391
25:22.000 --> 25:23.200
we need to eliminate.

392
25:23.720 --> 25:24.710
Should we still

393
25:25.090 --> 25:26.680
stick to morality and rules

394
25:26.700 --> 25:28.500
when dealing with people like him?

395
25:28.500 --> 25:29.960
But that doesn't justify twisting the truth

396
25:29.960 --> 25:31.020
or framing people!

397
25:32.090 --> 25:32.850
This goes against

398
25:32.850 --> 25:34.770
the original purpose of our paper!

399
25:34.770 --> 25:36.830
We're seeking the truth,

400
25:37.090 --> 25:38.660
not fabrication!

401
25:39.050 --> 25:40.580
That depends on the target.

402
25:42.050 --> 25:43.380
There was nothing wrong

403
25:44.460 --> 25:46.060
with the way we handled this.

404
25:49.590 --> 25:51.150
There's no point in arguing about it now.

405
25:51.150 --> 25:52.060
But I will not

406
25:52.540 --> 25:54.060
allow you to do this again.

407
26:00.110 --> 26:00.740
Pingjun.

408
26:14.820 --> 26:16.150
What are you doing here?

409
26:17.420 --> 26:18.810
I can't believe

410
26:20.240 --> 26:21.740
it was you who used the photo

411
26:21.740 --> 26:23.270
to frame Yu Changxuan.

412
26:25.530 --> 26:27.140
Why are you so worked up?

413
26:30.590 --> 26:32.050
You were very brave today.

414
26:33.000 --> 26:33.770
You went alone

415
26:33.770 --> 26:35.370
to the Yu Army headquarters,

416
26:36.070 --> 26:37.610
defending Yu Changxuan

417
26:38.200 --> 26:39.810
and clearing his name.

418
26:41.180 --> 26:41.660
Yes.

419
26:44.420 --> 26:45.220
I did it.

420
26:48.400 --> 26:49.900
What do you mean by that?

421
26:52.400 --> 26:53.550
Nothing.

422
26:55.640 --> 26:56.440
That's right.

423
26:57.940 --> 26:58.610
After all, the two of you...

424
26:58.610 --> 26:59.720
The two of us?

425
27:02.420 --> 27:03.220
Xueting,

426
27:04.590 --> 27:04.940
I have

427
27:04.940 --> 27:06.310
explained to you many times

428
27:06.310 --> 27:07.380
that nothing ever happened

429
27:07.380 --> 27:09.240
between Yu Changxuan and me.

430
27:12.440 --> 27:13.240
Pingjun,

431
27:15.660 --> 27:17.190
I have no right to blame you,

432
27:18.270 --> 27:19.330
because I know that

433
27:19.830 --> 27:20.500
you did all this

434
27:20.500 --> 27:21.530
for me, and you were

435
27:21.530 --> 27:22.510
forced to play along with him.

436
27:22.510 --> 27:24.220
But listen, for Yu Changxuan,

437
27:25.640 --> 27:27.440
no matter what I have to do,

438
27:27.550 --> 27:28.240
even if it

439
27:28.240 --> 27:28.960
disgusts you,

440
27:28.960 --> 27:30.690
I will make sure he goes to hell.

441
27:33.570 --> 27:34.550
But that's

442
27:34.550 --> 27:35.810
in the past.

443
27:37.070 --> 27:37.850
I don't want it

444
27:37.850 --> 27:38.850
to be stuck in your heart

445
27:38.850 --> 27:40.220
like a thorn!

446
27:41.070 --> 27:42.420
It has made you lose your mind,

447
27:42.420 --> 27:43.310
Jiang Xueting!

448
27:52.000 --> 27:54.200
Are you worried about me losing my mind,

449
27:55.660 --> 27:56.350
or are you worried

450
27:56.350 --> 27:57.420
that I will deal

451
27:57.420 --> 27:59.150
with Yu Changxuan by all means?

452
28:25.140 --> 28:25.940
Xueting.

453
28:30.310 --> 28:32.010
If there's no trust

454
28:33.920 --> 28:35.440
left between us

455
28:35.440 --> 28:36.640
at all,

456
28:39.770 --> 28:40.770
what's the point

457
28:40.770 --> 28:42.090
of us being together?

458
28:47.920 --> 28:49.030
Hands off me!

459
29:10.850 --> 29:13.670
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

460
29:27.810 --> 29:29.610
What on earth are you looking at?

461
29:30.480 --> 29:32.220
I'm looking at Fifth Young Master Yu.

462
29:32.220 --> 29:33.080
Think about it.

463
29:33.660 --> 29:34.810
He's waited so long for this,

464
29:34.810 --> 29:36.010
and Ye Pingjun finally

465
29:36.010 --> 29:37.220
risked her life to save him.

466
29:37.220 --> 29:38.460
How could he not be excited?

467
29:38.460 --> 29:40.350
How could he not have expectations?

468
29:40.350 --> 29:41.180
What a pity.

469
29:41.310 --> 29:42.460
The two of them are

470
29:42.460 --> 29:43.610
both so stubborn.

471
29:43.660 --> 29:45.120
Why are they so obstinate?

472
29:45.160 --> 29:47.630
All they need now is a little help

473
29:47.650 --> 29:48.540
from Cupid,

474
29:48.570 --> 29:49.970
and they'll be together.

475
29:51.960 --> 29:53.220
That's all you've been

476
29:53.810 --> 29:55.160
thinking about the whole morning?

477
29:55.160 --> 29:56.090
Oh, my goodness.

478
29:56.100 --> 29:58.030
This is what really matters, okay?

479
29:58.160 --> 29:59.020
You blockhead.

480
29:59.180 --> 30:00.220
It's a waste of time

481
30:00.220 --> 30:01.680
talking to you about this.

482
30:01.750 --> 30:02.550
Tell you what,

483
30:03.770 --> 30:05.770
Fifth Young Master Yu's ship of love

484
30:06.110 --> 30:08.240
still needs me to keep it from sinking.

485
30:10.290 --> 30:11.200
Bro,

486
30:12.500 --> 30:13.310
wish me luck.

487
30:40.050 --> 30:42.050
Boren, are you asking for a beating?

488
30:44.310 --> 30:45.310
Here's the thing.

489
30:45.920 --> 30:46.740
This year,

490
30:47.140 --> 30:48.850
the maple leaves at Baidu Bridge

491
30:48.850 --> 30:50.110
have turned red again.

492
30:50.350 --> 30:51.940
Don't you want to go

493
30:51.940 --> 30:53.510
take a look?

494
30:53.510 --> 30:54.640
I'm not interested.

495
30:55.400 --> 30:56.160
Yeah,

496
30:56.510 --> 30:59.720
as they say, a lovely view is best enjoyed with a beautiful lady.

497
30:59.720 --> 31:00.660
How about

498
31:00.750 --> 31:02.570
you go together with Miss Ye

499
31:02.570 --> 31:04.070
to enjoy the view?

500
31:06.090 --> 31:07.510
How many times do I have to tell you?

501
31:07.510 --> 31:09.310
Don't bring her up in front of me.

502
31:10.740 --> 31:12.160
It's one rule for you

503
31:12.160 --> 31:13.890
and another for everyone else.

504
31:16.500 --> 31:17.400
Be honest with yourself—

505
31:17.400 --> 31:18.050
have you ever

506
31:18.050 --> 31:19.850
truly let go when it comes to her?

507
31:22.200 --> 31:23.850
I've completely let it go this time.

508
31:23.850 --> 31:25.250
You simply can't do it!

509
31:25.810 --> 31:26.570
Look, you two

510
31:26.570 --> 31:27.570
have risked your lives

511
31:27.570 --> 31:28.550
saving each other.

512
31:28.550 --> 31:30.110
Since you've already entrusted your lives to each other,

513
31:30.110 --> 31:31.180
I just don't understand why

514
31:31.180 --> 31:32.640
you two can't be together!

515
31:34.570 --> 31:35.770
From the day I met you,

516
31:36.010 --> 31:37.720
I knew you were a man with great vision,

517
31:37.720 --> 31:38.790
never dithering

518
31:38.790 --> 31:40.320
or leaving things hanging.

519
31:41.720 --> 31:42.510
I don't believe you're

520
31:42.510 --> 31:43.710
too scared to see her.

521
31:53.720 --> 31:54.580
Let me tell you,

522
31:54.790 --> 31:56.590
Miss Ye has already agreed to go.

523
31:56.740 --> 31:57.540
Whether you go

524
31:58.090 --> 31:59.090
or not is up to you.

525
32:19.310 --> 32:20.810
Women's drama club?

526
32:25.770 --> 32:27.530
Well, my distant cousin

527
32:28.380 --> 32:30.530
is preparing for her debut performance.

528
32:30.530 --> 32:31.290
But they ran into

529
32:31.290 --> 32:33.270
a serious script problem at the last minute.

530
32:33.270 --> 32:35.000
You're quite famous for playwriting,

531
32:35.000 --> 32:36.460
so I came to you.

532
32:37.010 --> 32:37.770
I'd better pass.

533
32:37.770 --> 32:38.310
Wait.

534
32:39.160 --> 32:40.060
We've known each other

535
32:40.060 --> 32:40.720
for so long.

536
32:40.980 --> 32:41.840
No matter what,

537
32:42.290 --> 32:44.020
you should do me a favor, right?

538
32:44.070 --> 32:44.880
How about this?

539
32:44.880 --> 32:45.920
Tonight at 7:00, let's meet

540
32:45.920 --> 32:47.480
in the Linyuetai private room at Taifeng Restaurant.

541
32:47.480 --> 32:47.920
I will

542
32:48.030 --> 32:49.070
send a car to pick you up.

543
32:49.070 --> 32:49.730
It's a deal.

544
32:50.180 --> 32:50.780
Thank you.

545
33:00.440 --> 33:05.220
[Taifeng Restaurant]

546
33:16.140 --> 33:17.140
This way, please.

547
33:23.510 --> 33:24.420
See?

548
33:24.660 --> 33:26.180
For important matters,

549
33:26.270 --> 33:28.240
I, Boren, am the really reliable one to count on.

550
33:28.240 --> 33:29.380
Leave it to someone else,

551
33:29.380 --> 33:30.710
and it'll be screwed up.

552
34:01.720 --> 34:02.510
It was Li Boren

553
34:02.510 --> 34:04.110
who asked me to come and help.

554
34:05.160 --> 34:06.960
I didn't know you were also here.

555
34:07.340 --> 34:08.429
I'm leaving right now.

556
34:08.429 --> 34:09.060
Hold on.

557
34:29.010 --> 34:30.070
Since you're here,

558
34:31.550 --> 34:33.150
watch the fireworks with me.

559
34:51.190 --> 34:52.650
Consider it...

560
34:55.000 --> 34:56.420
our final farewell.

561
35:19.330 --> 35:20.310
For a long time,

562
35:22.430 --> 35:24.890
there were only 3 things that mattered to me—

563
35:25.380 --> 35:26.170
the army,

564
35:27.160 --> 35:28.090
military power,

565
35:29.360 --> 35:30.160
and weapons.

566
35:31.890 --> 35:33.070
I once said that I'd go from having

567
35:33.070 --> 35:34.280
not a single soldier

568
35:36.210 --> 35:38.010
to taking over the entire Yu Army

569
35:40.210 --> 35:42.070
and marching straight to Sujing.

570
35:42.960 --> 35:44.750
To achieve this goal,

571
35:45.460 --> 35:47.060
I would do whatever it takes.

572
35:48.500 --> 35:49.830
All I ever thought about

573
35:51.210 --> 35:52.870
was weighing the pros and cons

574
35:53.760 --> 35:55.820
and making trade-offs for benefits.

575
35:57.010 --> 35:57.610
I always believed

576
35:57.610 --> 35:59.610
that so-called love was a weakness,

577
36:00.050 --> 36:01.650
something that held you back

578
36:02.760 --> 36:04.360
from progressing to success

579
36:06.260 --> 36:08.320
and made you lose control of yourself

580
36:09.050 --> 36:10.110
and lose your mind.

581
36:12.570 --> 36:13.900
But I didn't expect that

582
36:15.460 --> 36:17.320
you'd become the only exception.

583
36:21.130 --> 36:23.530
When I heard that you were getting engaged,

584
36:24.800 --> 36:27.260
I locked you up in Fengtai against your will.

585
36:29.070 --> 36:30.170
I told myself that

586
36:31.780 --> 36:33.380
as long as I kept you by my side

587
36:35.000 --> 36:36.930
and treated you well day after day,

588
36:39.000 --> 36:41.000
you would eventually be moved by me.

589
36:43.860 --> 36:45.720
But I underestimated your pride.

590
36:48.550 --> 36:49.360
The moment I saw you

591
36:49.360 --> 36:51.050
lying in that pool of blood,

592
36:54.010 --> 36:55.210
I finally understood

593
36:57.650 --> 36:58.580
that I was wrong.

594
37:05.760 --> 37:07.090
I finally realized that

595
37:10.550 --> 37:12.610
I couldn't keep you with me after all.

596
37:15.440 --> 37:16.760
I had to let go.

597
37:20.650 --> 37:22.780
When I was fighting on the front lines,

598
37:24.320 --> 37:25.670
I wasn't some invincible hero

599
37:25.670 --> 37:27.180
as everybody said.

600
37:31.030 --> 37:33.440
I stared death in the face time and again.

601
37:34.730 --> 37:36.630
What supported me to rise

602
37:37.530 --> 37:39.690
from the bloody battlefield

603
37:44.670 --> 37:46.470
was the hope to go back to see you.

604
37:55.150 --> 37:57.150
After everything that's happened,

605
38:00.360 --> 38:02.090
I have finally seen through it.

606
38:05.090 --> 38:06.050
You were right.

607
38:07.730 --> 38:08.490
We are

608
38:08.520 --> 38:09.960
worlds apart,

609
38:11.760 --> 38:13.620
never meant to truly cross paths.

610
38:17.480 --> 38:18.820
The gap between us

611
38:20.480 --> 38:22.070
can never be bridged.

612
38:31.650 --> 38:33.210
Sorry, Yu Changxuan.

613
38:35.880 --> 38:37.570
I don't know how to respond

614
38:37.570 --> 38:38.610
to your feelings.

615
38:40.260 --> 38:42.300
Ever since we met,

616
38:43.550 --> 38:44.780
my life has completely

617
38:44.780 --> 38:46.010
gone off course.

618
38:50.030 --> 38:52.030
You don't need to feel any pressure.

619
38:53.530 --> 38:54.920
When the fireworks end,

620
38:56.210 --> 38:56.920
I will disappear

621
38:56.920 --> 38:58.320
from your world for good.

622
39:00.650 --> 39:01.260
And then,

623
39:02.760 --> 39:04.690
I won't show up in your world again.

624
39:06.000 --> 39:07.200
And you will no longer

625
39:09.650 --> 39:10.850
be in my world either.

626
39:42.090 --> 39:46.210
[Though miles apart, we share the same falling snow.]

627
39:46.210 --> 39:50.340
[We may consider it our way of growing old together.]

628
41:27.980 --> 41:29.380
I've only been in Tianjin for a few days.

629
41:29.380 --> 41:30.880
How did this happen?

630
41:31.510 --> 41:32.400
Yu Changxuan suddenly asked

631
41:32.400 --> 41:34.210
to cancel the engagement with Ziyi.

632
41:34.210 --> 41:35.840
She came home and cried all night,

633
41:35.840 --> 41:37.570
smashing everything in sight.

634
41:37.650 --> 41:39.510
She hasn't eaten or drunk in days.

635
41:39.550 --> 41:40.800
She refused to see the doctor

636
41:40.800 --> 41:42.590
and even kicked him out.

637
41:42.820 --> 41:44.070
I was at my wits' end,

638
41:44.110 --> 41:45.650
so I called you.

639
41:57.500 --> 41:58.190
Ziyi.

640
42:02.920 --> 42:03.530
Ziyi,

641
42:04.030 --> 42:04.860
it's Dad.

642
42:29.050 --> 42:29.780
Ziyi,

643
42:30.630 --> 42:31.960
I've heard everything.

644
42:32.550 --> 42:33.280
Don't worry!

645
42:33.820 --> 42:35.150
I will definitely make the Yu family

646
42:35.150 --> 42:36.550
give you an explanation.

647
42:48.420 --> 42:49.440
Listen to me

648
42:50.300 --> 42:51.700
and eat something first.

649
42:52.550 --> 42:54.150
Have something to eat, Ziyi.

650
42:54.920 --> 42:55.960
You are such a catch.

651
42:55.960 --> 42:57.340
There are plenty of talented young men

652
42:57.340 --> 42:58.430
for you to pick.

653
42:58.570 --> 42:59.400
Why waste

654
42:59.400 --> 43:00.190
your tears

655
43:00.190 --> 43:01.650
on a heartless man?

656
43:02.460 --> 43:02.800
Here,

657
43:03.110 --> 43:03.840
eat something.

658
43:03.840 --> 43:05.360
Eat something, Ziyi.

659
43:06.820 --> 43:07.610
Dad.

660
43:09.020 --> 43:10.350
You know what?

661
43:12.070 --> 43:14.320
I've made such a huge compromise.

662
43:15.590 --> 43:17.260
I swallowed my pride

663
43:18.110 --> 43:19.550
and gave up

664
43:20.230 --> 43:21.980
my dignity and self-respect.

665
43:24.820 --> 43:27.150
But he still asked to break up with me.

666
43:29.000 --> 43:29.710
Nonsense!

667
43:31.150 --> 43:32.480
Even if you agree,

668
43:32.650 --> 43:33.910
I still won't allow it.

669
43:34.670 --> 43:36.200
Yu Changxuan

670
43:36.630 --> 43:38.470
used us, and then cast you aside,

671
43:38.550 --> 43:40.210
and humiliated you like this!

672
43:40.630 --> 43:41.320
I

673
43:42.260 --> 43:43.360
definitely will

674
43:43.360 --> 43:44.760
make him pay for this!

675
43:45.820 --> 43:46.730
Ziyi,

676
43:47.260 --> 43:48.860
with your dad backing you up,

677
43:48.920 --> 43:49.780
Yu Changxuan will definitely

678
43:49.780 --> 43:50.980
change his mind.

679
43:55.570 --> 43:56.630
It's pointless.

680
43:58.460 --> 44:00.380
He's made up his mind.

681
44:01.960 --> 44:03.900
No one can change it.

682
44:06.460 --> 44:07.650
He has already

683
44:10.400 --> 44:12.280
fallen for Ye Pingjun.

684
44:13.380 --> 44:14.570
Who is Ye Pingjun?

685
44:16.610 --> 44:17.820
The girl who injured

686
44:17.820 --> 44:19.110
Ziyi's face last time.

687
44:22.970 --> 44:24.940
It's her again!

688
44:37.070 --> 44:37.880
Pingjun!

689
44:38.670 --> 44:39.920
Take out those sweaters from my closet

690
44:39.920 --> 44:41.610
that I don't usually wear.

691
44:41.780 --> 44:42.820
It's sunny today.

692
44:42.940 --> 44:46.140
I want to air them out in the sun, so they'll be warm to wear.

693
44:47.440 --> 44:48.010
Pingjun?

694
44:49.730 --> 44:50.530
Pingjun!

695
44:51.380 --> 44:51.980
Mom!

696
44:53.670 --> 44:54.550
On my way.

697
45:16.670 --> 45:18.170
Isn't this

698
45:19.070 --> 45:21.530
the sachet where Mom keeps her jade pendant?

699
45:32.800 --> 45:33.590
Mom.

700
45:34.280 --> 45:35.870
We used to have a jade pendant

701
45:35.870 --> 45:37.550
with a bamboo leaf pattern carved on it.

702
45:37.550 --> 45:38.610
Do you remember it?

703
45:42.280 --> 45:43.440
You mean that one?

704
45:44.150 --> 45:45.860
Two years ago, our roof was leaking,

705
45:45.860 --> 45:46.940
and I pawned it

706
45:47.530 --> 45:48.480
to fix the roof.

707
46:08.410 --> 46:12.830
[Hall of Heavenly Kings]

708
46:16.780 --> 46:18.040
Fifth Young Master Yu,

709
46:18.710 --> 46:20.040
obsession is like fire.

710
46:20.980 --> 46:21.980
Only by letting go

711
46:22.360 --> 46:23.550
can one find peace.

712
46:26.880 --> 46:28.070
Without this light,

713
46:30.760 --> 46:32.710
the road ahead would be too cold.

714
46:36.880 --> 46:38.800
There are quite a few people here to pray today.

715
46:38.800 --> 46:39.480
Yeah,

716
46:40.130 --> 46:43.260
Fifth Young Master Yu, you've graced our temple so much.

717
46:43.380 --> 46:45.560
It is truly a blessing for us.

718
46:49.050 --> 46:49.570
Please.

719
47:06.590 --> 47:09.820
[Prayer]

720
47:19.790 --> 47:25.330
[Prayer]

721
47:35.980 --> 47:37.380
The body returns to dust,

722
47:39.340 --> 47:40.900
but true love never fades.

723
47:55.280 --> 47:58.980
Thank you, Bodhisattva, for blessing his safe return from the battlefield.

724
47:58.980 --> 48:00.000
Otherwise,

725
48:00.980 --> 48:02.130
I would never have the chance

726
48:02.130 --> 48:03.390
to thank him in person.

727
48:04.320 --> 48:07.340
I have come again specifically to express my gratitude.

728
48:07.340 --> 48:09.740
May we both find peace from now on.

729
48:10.860 --> 48:12.590
May everything go well for him.

730
48:20.110 --> 48:20.730
Abbot,

731
48:21.850 --> 48:24.130
where did these prayer sachets come from?

732
48:24.130 --> 48:25.780
They're from the worshippers who have made

733
48:25.780 --> 48:27.710
oil offerings over the past month.

734
48:30.540 --> 48:31.640
I want to see the list.
